\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">: Pahriyadi,\r\nS.Ap<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n3\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Anggota                                            </span>    <span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">   : Rita Lesnawati, S.Pd<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-outline-level:\r\n3\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">                                                                : Ina Ramadhani Rahmatin, S.H<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">                                                                : Fira Aulia Rahmadani, S.T.P<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">                                                                : M. Erfan Fadhillah, S.Sos.,\r\nM.Sos<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">                                                                : Nadia Sapira Putri, S.Pd<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-outline-level:\r\n2\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">1. Bidang Pengumpulan<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Tugas\r\nPokok :</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Melaksanakan\r\nkegiatan penghimpunan dana zakat, infak, sedekah, dan dana sosial keagamaan\r\nlainnya sesuai target dan ketentuan yang berlaku.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Fungsi:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Melakukan\r\n     sosialisasi dan edukasi zakat kepada masyarakat dan lembaga.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Menjalin\r\n     kerja sama dengan instansi, perusahaan, dan komunitas untuk penghimpunan\r\n     dana.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Mengelola\r\n     data muzakki (pemberi zakat) dan donatur.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Menyusun\r\n     laporan hasil pengumpulan secara berkala.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Melaksanakan\r\n     inovasi dan strategi pemasaran (fundraising).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">2.\r\nBidang Pendistribusian dan Pendayagunaan</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Tugas\r\nPokok:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Menyalurkan\r\ndan memberdayakan dana zakat, infak, dan sedekah sesuai dengan ketentuan\r\nsyariah dan prioritas kebutuhan mustahik.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Fungsi:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Melakukan\r\n     pendataan dan verifikasi calon mustahik (penerima manfaat).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Menyusun\r\n     program penyaluran (konsumtif dan produktif).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Melaksanakan\r\n     distribusi bantuan kepada mustahik dengan tepat sasaran.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Membuat\r\n     laporan kegiatan dan pertanggungjawaban penggunaan dana.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Melakukan\r\n     evaluasi dan monitoring efektivitas program pendayagunaan.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> </span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">3.\r\nBidang Teknologi Informasi (IT)</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Tugas\r\nPokok :</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nmajor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"> <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Mengelola\r\nsistem informasi, jaringan, dan teknologi pendukung operasional lembaga agar\r\nberjalan efektif, efisien, dan aman.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify\"><b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Fungsi:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\";mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Mengembangkan\r\n     dan memelihara website, aplikasi, serta sistem database.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Menjamin\r\n     keamanan data donatur, mustahik, dan transaksi.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Memberikan\r\n     dukungan teknis untuk seluruh bidang (support & troubleshooting).<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Mengelola\r\n     infrastruktur jaringan dan perangkat komputer.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3;\r\n     tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Cambria\",serif;\r\n     mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n     mso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Membuat\r\n     inovasi digital untuk meningkatkan transparansi dan kemudahan layanan\r\n     zakat.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNorma